"<p>If you want complete control over your compose files or are building from a local checkout, you can run Nitrobase directly with Docker Compose v2.</p>\n<h2>Prerequisites</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Docker Engine with Docker Compose v2 (<code>docker compose</code>).</li>\n<li>OpenSSL CLI (<code>openssl</code>) for generating random secrets.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Option A: Official Release Artifacts</h2>\n<p>In an empty directory, download <code>docker-compose.prod.yml</code> and <code>.env.example</code> from the same release on <a href=\"https://github.com/AydenGroup/nitrobase/releases\">GitHub Releases</a>:</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mkdir</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nitrobase</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nitrobase</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">VERSION</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">0.1.0-beta.9</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">BASE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://github.com/AydenGroup/nitrobase/releases/download/v</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$VERSION</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -fsSL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose.yaml</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$BASE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/docker-compose.prod.yml\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -fsSL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .env</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$BASE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/env.example\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> key </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ENCRYPTION_KEY</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> SESSION_SECRET</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> POSTGRES_PASSWORD</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  sed</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i.bak</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"s|^</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$key</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=.*|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$key</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=$(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openssl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rand </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-hex</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 32</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)|\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">done</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i.bak</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"s|^NITROBASE_VERSION=.*|NITROBASE_VERSION=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$VERSION</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">|\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rm</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .env.bak</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chmod</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 600</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># For pre-releases, enable pre-release update checks:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">case</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$VERSION</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">-</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">)</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> echo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"RELEASE_CHANNEL=prerelease\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .env</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ;; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">esac</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> up</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> logs</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Setup token\"</span></span></code></pre>\n<h2>Option B: Build from a Local Git Checkout</h2>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/AydenGroup/nitrobase.git</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nitrobase</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cp</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .env.example</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> key </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ENCRYPTION_KEY</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> SESSION_SECRET</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> POSTGRES_PASSWORD</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  sed</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"s|^</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$key</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=.*|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$key</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=$(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openssl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rand </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-hex</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 32</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)|\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">done</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's|^NITROBASE_IMAGE=.*|NITROBASE_IMAGE=nitrobase|; s|^NITROBASE_VERSION=.*|NITROBASE_VERSION=local|'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chmod</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 600</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> docker-compose.prod.yml</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> docker-compose.build.yml</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> up</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --build</span></span></code></pre>\n<div class=\"docCallout docCallout-caution\"><div class=\"docCalloutHeader\"><span class=\"docCalloutBadge\">CAUTION</span><span class=\"docCalloutTitle\">Back Up Your ENCRYPTION_KEY</span></div><div class=\"docCalloutContent\">\n<p>Store <code>.env</code>—especially <code>ENCRYPTION_KEY</code>—in a password manager outside the server. Without <code>ENCRYPTION_KEY</code>, stored credentials, SSH keys, and encrypted backups cannot be decrypted.</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2>Core Environment Variables</h2>\n<p>Any runtime setting defined in <code>src/config/server.ts</code> can be placed in <code>.env</code> (loaded via <code>env_file</code> in <code>docker-compose.prod.yml</code>). The server refuses to start if a required secret is missing, shorter than 32 characters, or a known placeholder.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th align=\"left\">Variable</th><th align=\"left\">Required</th><th align=\"left\">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>DATABASE_URL</code></td><td align=\"left\"><strong>Yes</strong></td><td align=\"left\">PostgreSQL connection string (in <code>docker-compose.prod.yml</code>, built automatically from <code>POSTGRES_PASSWORD</code>).</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>ENCRYPTION_KEY</code></td><td align=\"left\"><strong>Yes</strong></td><td align=\"left\">At least 32 random characters. Encrypts all secrets at rest (AES-256-GCM + HKDF).</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>ENCRYPTION_KEY_PREVIOUS</code></td><td align=\"left\">No</td><td align=\"left\">Comma-separated previous encryption keys (newest first) kept after key rotation so older backups remain restorable.</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>SESSION_SECRET</code></td><td align=\"left\"><strong>Yes</strong></td><td align=\"left\">At least 32 random characters. Seals session cookies.</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>POSTGRES_PASSWORD</code></td><td align=\"left\"><strong>Yes</strong>*</td><td align=\"left\">Used by <code>docker-compose.prod.yml</code> for the bundled <code>postgres:16-alpine</code> container (use hex).</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>NITROBASE_VERSION</code></td><td align=\"left\"><strong>Yes</strong>*</td><td align=\"left\">Image tag to run (e.g. <code>0.1.0-beta.9</code>). Updated automatically by in-panel upgrades.</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>NITROBASE_IMAGE</code></td><td align=\"left\">No</td><td align=\"left\">Panel image without tag (default <code>ghcr.io/aydengroup/nitrobase</code>).</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>PANEL_BIND</code></td><td align=\"left\">No</td><td align=\"left\">Host bind address and port (default <code>0.0.0.0:3000</code>). Set to <code>127.0.0.1:3000</code> once behind HTTPS.</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>APP_URL</code></td><td align=\"left\">No</td><td align=\"left\">Public URL of the panel (e.g. <code>https://panel.example.com</code>). Session cookies are marked <code>Secure</code> only when this starts with <code>https://</code>.</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>TRUST_PROXY</code></td><td align=\"left\">No</td><td align=\"left\">Set to <code>true</code> when behind Traefik or another reverse proxy so rate limits and audit logs see real client IPs (<code>TRUSTED_PROXY_HOPS</code>, default <code>1</code>).</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>ACME_EMAIL</code></td><td align=\"left\">No</td><td align=\"left\">Let's Encrypt registration email (defaults to the administrator's email).</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>GITHUB_TOKEN</code></td><td align=\"left\">No</td><td align=\"left\">Optional GitHub token to raise API rate limits when listing template versions.</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>SETUP_TOKEN</code></td><td align=\"left\">No</td><td align=\"left\">One-time token (min 16 chars) for initial admin signup or first-run restore. If omitted, Nitrobase generates one and prints it in logs.</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>RELEASE_CHANNEL</code></td><td align=\"left\">No</td><td align=\"left\"><code>stable</code> (default) or <code>prerelease</code> to receive beta/pre-release upgrade notifications.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>* Required when using <code>docker-compose.prod.yml</code>.</p>"